sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Application
    participant V as Vault core
    box rgb(221,242,234) stored data
        participant S as SQLite vault
        participant I as FAISS and BM25
    end
    A->>V: add_batch(texts)
    Note over V: check role, embed texts,<br/>check vector dimension
    V->>S: BEGIN, insert rows
    V->>S: bump generation, COMMIT
    V->>I: add vectors and postings
    alt index update fails
        V->>S: delete inserted rows
        V->>I: rebuild from stored vectors
        V-->>A: error, vault unchanged
    else success
        V-->>A: document ids
    end
